            },
            "reviewBody": "This is just like the recipe on the box of pudding, except it uses less milk, which is an important distinction because it makes a thick, rich pudding. I tripled the recipe and it was perfect for 2 deep dish pies. I made my own whipped cream. Thanks!! Everybody loved it.",
            "datePublished": "2015-03-13T14:52:02.980Z"
