              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TommyFreckles"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Love this recipe. Extremely easy, fairly simple clean up &amp; the pudding pie... oh my my. I added some Almond milk in while cooking and also included berries for a topping which was a nice addition. I made it for a super bowl party, Go Pats!",
